 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README_KIOSK.md b/README_KIOSK.md
index 5f529b8..7b99da7 100644
--- a/README_KIOSK.md
+++ b/README_KIOSK.md
@@ -43,9 +43,16 @@ versions get a release of their own.
 
 ## Keeping up with upstream
 
+This repo holds a snapshot of upstream (without its `releases/` folder of old binaries)
+plus one commit with the kiosk patch. To move to a newer upstream:
+
 ```
-git remote add upstream https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer
-git fetch upstream
-git rebase upstream/master     # the patch is small, so conflicts are rare
-git push --force-with-lease
+git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer /tmp/upstream
+git format-patch -1 <kiosk commit> -o /tmp/patch     # save the patch
+# replace everything except .git, README_KIOSK.md and .github with /tmp/upstream's
+# files (minus releases/), commit as "Import Main_MiSTer upstream <hash>", then:
+git am /tmp/patch/*.patch
 ```
+
+The patch is small, so it rarely conflicts. A copy is kept in MisterOperator's
+`fork/` folder.
